  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math> such that the area of the triangle formed by the tangent at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>, &nbsp;on the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math> and the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>unit</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mi>a</mi></math> is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "146",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math> such that the area of the triangle formed by the tangent at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>, &nbsp;on the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>And the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>unit</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now plotting the diagram we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6407af52-7eb7-49c8-b634-511dbac592f5-9896436.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 368px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;it meets <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now area of triangle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;as both belongs to natural number,</p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> lie on parabola hence satisfy it</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>32</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now when possible value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>128</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>146</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
